1
00:00:00,670 --> 00:00:04,348
Rent notice.
Reduced to one percent.

2
00:00:04,388 --> 00:00:06,579
It still says
twelve hundred.

3
00:00:06,619 --> 00:00:08,873
Not if he can't read it.

4
00:00:11,101 --> 00:00:13,840
Miss Volt.
It's next month.

5
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,291
Your notice is right there.

6
00:00:16,461 --> 00:00:19,457
Twelve hundred.
Friday.

7
00:00:19,497 --> 00:00:22,080
You brought
a magnifying glass?

8
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,574
Last month,
you had a laser.

9
00:00:24,614 --> 00:00:26,790
It was a pointer.

10
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:32,106
...Okay.
I can read it.

11
00:00:32,146 --> 00:00:34,165
Friday.
